Z||000010||Raydar||07-06-2001||10:30 PM||||A friend in H.S. (1973 or so) was telling me about his cousin and his 4 speed 396 Chevelle. <BR>Was drag racing one day. Wound out 1st and speed shifted into second. <BR>Wound out second and speed shifted <I>back into first</I>.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>He said that engine parts came out through the hood. <P><BR>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 07-06-2001).]||||reg||1
